activate Table
Table --> Service: 6: User or no active account
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 7: Recheck ACTIVE status
alt Active account
Service -> Service: 8: Remove authentication secrets from public user payload
Service --> API: 9: Current account
API --> Page: 10: HTTP 200: Current account
Page --> Actor: 11: Show authorized result
else Account not usable
Service --> API: 8.1: Session no longer usable
API --> Page: 8.2: HTTP 401
Page --> Actor: 8.3: Display error; do not report success
end
deactivate Service
else Invalid input, missing session or insufficient role
API --> Page: 4.1: HTTP 422 / 401 / 403 (429 only if rate-limited)
Page --> Actor: 4.2: Show appropriate error; retain form/draft
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

